msgstr ""
"<a href=\"/education/education.html\">Educação</a> &rarr; <a href=\"/"
"education/edu-cases.html\">Estudos de Casos</a> &rarr; <a href=\"/education/"
"edu-cases-argentina.html\">Argentina</a> &rarr; Escuela Cristiana Evangélica "
